{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34164","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 桃花坞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 桃花坞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行行问绝境，贵与名相亲。\n空经桃花坞，不见秦时人。\n愿此爲东风，吹起枝上春。\n愿此作流水，潜浮蘂中尘。\n愿此爲好鸟，得栖花际邻。\n愿此作幽蝶，得随花下宾。\n朝爲照花日，暮作涵花津。\n试爲探花士，作此偷桃臣。\n桃源不我弃，庶可全天真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}